menu "OTA update"

config OTA_ERASE_NVS_ON_BOOT
    bool "Erase NVS + storage on first boot after OTA"
    default n
    help
        When enabled, the first boot after a successful OTA (image
        pending verify) erases the nvs and storage partitions before
        connecting. The device then enters Wi-Fi provisioning (AP
        SireneValidator). Disable for normal production OTA updates.

endmenu
